        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>4 1/2\" x 4 1/2\" x Square Corners Commercial Brushed Stainless Steel Hinge</b>\r\n<p>Heavy duty solid stainless steel commercial grade door hinge with 2 ball bearings and Non-Removable Pin (NRP). \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSecurity Non-Removable Pin for exterior outswing doors, prevents the hinge pins removal by vandals and thieves. For additional protection we offer <a href=\"/collections/security-door-bars\"><b>Exit Door Security Bars</b></a> which prevent an exit doors removal, even if the hinges are cut by burglars!\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for 4 1/2\" x 4 1/2\" Non-Removable Pin Stainless Steel Hinge\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.134\"</li>\r\n<li>Ball Bearings: 2 Ball Bearings for Smooth Action</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12  x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Removable Pin for Security</li>\r\n<li>US32D <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b> Finish</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Hinge Pin</li>\r\n<li>Conforms to ANSI A5112 for Stainless Steel Bearing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CS4545BB.pdf?v=1704262227\" target=\"new\"><b>Global CS4545BBNRP Hinge Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackage with Stainless Steel machine screws and wood screws. For use with both metal and wood  doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
